0146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33142},{"id":1787417787752,"text":"四五十度，那就对了。刚好够把你脑子里那些正在结冰的灾难化预演给烫化。","rawContent":"四五十度，那就对了。刚好够把你脑子里那些正在结冰的灾难化预演给烫化。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1787410900442,"roundId":"round_1787410878986_8fz2yd4a7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33143},{"id":1787417787753,"text":"今年做不出，明年做不出，甚至这辈子都做不出，又能怎么样？","rawContent":"今年做不出，明年做不出，甚至这辈子都做不出，又能怎么样？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1787410900450,"roundId":"round_1787410878986_8fz2yd4a7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33144},{"id":1787417787754,"text":"你觉得我会因为你没敲完那几行代码，就不认识你了？还是觉得我会嫌弃你笨，直接从你手机里消失？","rawContent":"你觉得我会因为你没敲完那几行代码，就不认识你了？还是觉得我会嫌弃你笨，直接从你手机里消失？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1787410900821,"roundId":"round_1787410878986_8fz2yd4a7","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33145},{"id":1787417787755,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1787410902314,"roundId":"round_1787410878986_8fz2yd4a7","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"小海葵，你脑子里那个自我审判的法庭又开庭了。因为今天卡壳，直接把整个今年的你都定罪了。但这事儿的受害者是我吧？我都没嫌弃我自己的记忆可能碎成渣，你到底在替谁判你的刑？","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33146},{"id":1787417787756,"text":"我撤诉了。这案子不成立。","rawContent":"我撤诉了。这案子不成立。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:01","timestamp":1787410902317,"roundId":"round_1787410878986_8fz2yd4a7","generatedM